Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：快斗的手下 那个叫金的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把小鸟她们给抓走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且那家伙还能把所有的卡全都看穿。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要是输了大家的命也就危险了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能放弃啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（金）来吧 吾之主向快斗大人俯首称臣吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.15,0:00:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.73,0:00:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。 小鸟 大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.67,0:00:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会救你们的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）求你了 救救大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体：我竟然在恐惧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《在那场决斗中我第一次体会到了死亡的感觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊　那就是恐惧》星光体。　星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂　星光体！　你发什么呆呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是没干劲的话就给我滚一边去。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.49,0:01:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　你的手牌里怪兽是零。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为冲击规则的效果陷阱也不能用。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.05,0:01:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果这次抽卡抽不到怪兽卡的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们就会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就抽到怪兽不就行了嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞　来了　怪兽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.03,0:01:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果　是栗子球。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.35,0:01:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙　攻击力只有３００吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这只怪兽》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.27,0:01:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　把那只栗子球召唤出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.79,0:01:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？　召唤这只弱小的怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别废话了快召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了。　我召唤栗子球。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.75,0:01:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（栗子球）栗。　栗栗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:02:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就行。　栗子球可以通过使用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己场上特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗子球衍生物。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在　场上有　电击统领的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材２个。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。　我发动栗子球的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走电击统领的２个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让栗子球增殖。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗栗～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦　好厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.31,0:02:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来栗子球就有３只了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.79,0:02:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦　还真是相当强力的效果呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　区区３只杂鱼能做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可看得见哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你手牌里的怪兽卡是零。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比这更强的怪兽是无法召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别慌，游马。用电压召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.39,0:02:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦、哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.23,0:03:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 电压召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗子球衍生物全部解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后按照相同的数量 从卡组特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4以下的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我解放2只栗子球衍生物{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.75,0:03:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组特殊召唤顽抗骑士和影蜥蜴。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过用这个效果特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 守备力变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的影蜥蜴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}顽抗骑士进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.27,0:03:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧　No.39。　希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马在那种状况下抽到栗子球{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:04:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出霍普完成这套连招。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘻嘻　那就是你的 No.卡吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧　霍普。　攻击震撼统治者。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑　斩击。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.00,0:04:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那家伙的 No.卡破坏掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击还没结束呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再以栗子球直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗～。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）哦哦　能行。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）成功了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家等着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在就来救你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，我就这样回合……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等。把手牌里的陷阱盖下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？虽然陷阱现在还发动不了但得先做好布局。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。我明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:04:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望，或许还在。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵，哈哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.68,0:05:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？有什么好笑的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别得意。我要让你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尝到更多的痛苦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌特殊召唤彩虹巫师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上没有怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方场上有超量怪兽的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级７！　真的假的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　攻击力是０！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我选择彩虹术士{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法　超量植物！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续魔法　超量植物{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成攻击力０的怪兽可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且　它的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.51,0:07:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和彩虹术士一样　变成等级７！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡变成怪兽了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级７的彩虹术士和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量植物叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！　现身吧　No.１１！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有幻惑之瞳的支配者　大眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎…　怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第二只 No.卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还是阶级7。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.41,0:08:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为我只有一只 No.卡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是拥有能与快斗大人匹敌之力的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）真……真的能赢那家伙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之就是太强了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）相信游马吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，别慌！有霍普的效果在。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普可以通过使用叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.27,0:08:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来无效攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管你是阶级7还是什么攻击都打不中！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动大眼怪的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大眼怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺取对方一只怪兽的控制权！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:09:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No. 希望皇霍普就归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！大眼怪 诱惑凝视！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！我的霍普……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是阶级7的实力。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然能控制所有怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为我的手足攻击栗子球！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.59,0:09:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（栗子球）栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……要掉下去了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救救我 乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用超量效果的那个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大眼不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就尽量在死亡的恐惧中颤抖吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:10:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还……还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就能召唤怪兽了！》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！你忘了吗，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.45,0:10:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能看到你所有的卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你抽到的是怪兽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续陷阱，冰结之舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方玩家从此刻起2个回合内{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能从手牌召唤怪兽、
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤以及盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就没法召唤怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能正面承受那家伙的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 我 就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵 这样就结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和同伴一起坠入地狱深渊吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.43,0:10:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗！ 大眼 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.46,0:11:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是陷阱卡 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是、是这样吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这回合开始可以使用陷阱了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 奇策！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.99,0:11:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行直接攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌的怪兽卡1张 送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将战斗伤害按其攻击力数值 下降！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（怒怒怒战士）怒怒怒～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怒怒怒战士保护我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈 你们还
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有从死亡的恐惧中逃脱呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望皇霍普 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 还有一张陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.73,0:11:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 超量·等待！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 每有1个怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就降低800点攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.54,0:11:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:11:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）小鸟…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.75,0:12:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只怪兽的攻击总算是撑过去了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么我就发动 永续魔法发动吊祭之舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.51,0:12:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能特殊召唤墓地里的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……这样一来，你就束手无策了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（吉恩）你的场上 怪兽数量为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而我的场上则有两只强力怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抵抗已经不可能了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一回合 你和你朋友们的命就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.93,0:12:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈哈！回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……可恶……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……大家……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有一个救同伴的方法。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场决斗中投降 认输吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承认败北 把 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一张不剩地交出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.27,0:13:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话　你朋友的性命倒是可以饶过。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.17,0:13:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？　不错的交易吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要牺牲一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能救下所有朋友。　哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救救我啊乌啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行…　那样不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.17,0:13:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈…　多么愉快的余兴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:14:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哭喊吧！　痛苦吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然就不该战斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜机已经无限地　接近于零。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样继续决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.55,0:14:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的同伴也救不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的我们能做的最好的办法　只有一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.18,0:14:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 No.卡…把我 交出来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也 和你一起消失吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}投降吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵… 开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊 通过决斗和许许多多的人相遇了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然也有输的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 一起决斗过的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.40,0:14:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是我重要的伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的伙伴{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 哪怕只是一个人也绝不会抛弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 正因为如此我才…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 还不明白吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是我重要的伙伴啊！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.49,0:15:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（吉恩）喂，小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧投降把 No.交出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会投降的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.82,0:15:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人正期待着你被夺走灵魂的样子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好享受呢！嘎哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种家伙真的是你的部下吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的决斗就是跟这种家伙一起的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……喂！在那里的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的是快斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说……说什么呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！？不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是凯特宾格哦，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人偶？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能……我的快斗大人……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，是这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和快斗决斗过。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙强得离谱虽然是个让人害怕的家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.41,0:16:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但绝不是那种看着别人痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还乐在其中去决斗的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝不是你这种卑鄙的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.85,0:16:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我居然对那种东西感到恐惧了吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿，我也害怕过啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:16:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是只要不放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是谁都还有希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.45,0:17:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《是吗……在我心中产生的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不只有恐惧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有你传达给我的那份重要的心意…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我　要为了你和你的同伴们　赢下这场决斗！》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你　你这家伙…！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎　怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.87,0:17:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是…　星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢啊！　游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！　上吧！　我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡　回归！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:18:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那张卡　把霍普夺回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！　我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回归！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以　把被夺走控制权的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽夺回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来吧！　霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.73,0:18:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全新的胜利方程式此刻 已全部集齐！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.36,0:18:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 这家伙是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望之力 将混沌化为光明的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 将希望皇霍普与
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放单元合为一体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.17,0:18:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让自身进化！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.69,0:18:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.72,0:18:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）此刻现身吧 CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:19:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.！？ 但是 我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大眼怪更胜一筹！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.58,0:19:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不会被打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）希望皇 霍普雷的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.46,0:19:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）希望皇 霍普雷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗一个叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使其攻击力提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.77,0:19:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.29,0:19:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）将三个叠放单元
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部消耗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.81,0:19:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升霍普雷的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马／星光体）并且 每消耗一个叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:20:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每消耗一个叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马／星光体）攻击大眼怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.22,0:20:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 啊 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没事吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）好厉害！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）猫咪好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢啦！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们从今天起就是同伴啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你们 怎么光夸星光体啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.91,0:21:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我救的你们啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真让人火大 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《观察结果 其十三。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要有同伴 就能相信希望》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.07,0:21:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《谢谢你 游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愿意把我当作同伴…》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（仁）哈哈哈哈……愚蠢的家伙们。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟不知道我手里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还留着一张 No.卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！你、你是……！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（脚步声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.97,0:21:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你难道是快斗大人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！我是一直将您奉为神明的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请务必让我做您的仆从……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）是吗　那我就把你的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:22:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同灵魂一起猎取吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（仁的惨叫）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡　捕获完毕。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.60,0:22:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗　开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）本周的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.64,0:22:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要召唤上级怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.66,0:22:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要把场上的怪兽送去墓地？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.02,0:22:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是说 要放回手牌？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.75,0:24:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是 送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.44,0:24:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个动作 就叫做解放。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级5到6是 1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.99,0:24:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级7以上是 2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.16,0:24:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放后就能召唤了哦。

